ck out the BCD rate actually charged from the duty paid and the CIF value. Find the SKD shipments charged at the FG rate and work out the refund claim in rupees (BCD + SWS only)."}, {"id": "X5", "text": "**Supplier scorecard with weights.** Combine delay, document lateness, demurrage caused and price into one score, run a +/-10% sensitivity on each weight and say which suppliers stay in the top three."}, {"id": "X4", "text": "**Hedge or not.** If every supplier payment had been booked forward at the reference rate on the PO date, what would the company have saved or lost over the year? Show it by quarter."}]}$pack$::jsonb
