e, what would the company have saved or lost over the year? Show it by quarter."}, {"id": "X1", "text": "**Model it properly.** Design a normalised schema (supplier, product, PO, PO line with revisions, shipment, container, event, document, payment) and load it into a real SQL database. Rewrite S7 and S9 as single queries that take the report date as a parameter."}, {"id": "X5", "text": "**Supplier scorecard with weights.** Combine delay, document lateness, demurrage caused and price into one score, run a +/-10% sensitivity on each weight and say which suppliers stay in the top three."}]}$pack$::jsonb
