on", "title": "Phase 4, Documentation", "tasks": [{"id": "DOC1", "text": "Write a short project write-up (Word, PDF, Notion or a README) with three sections: (1) **Process Flow**: how you joined six messy files into one model, including revisions, event de-duplication and your as-of logic; (2) **Key Discoveries**: your top 3 to 5 findings, written for a head of supply chain; (3) **Recommendations**: at least 3 concrete, data-backed changes before the next festive season. Close with a one-page status note as of 21 June 2026: what is late, what documents to chase this week and what cash to arrange."}]}, {"key": "stretch", "title": "Stretch ideas (optional)", "tasks": [{"id": "X-S2", "text": "Estimate how many demurrage rupees would have been saved if Original BL / Telex Release had been chased 7 days before arrival on every shipment."}, {"id": "X-S1", "text": "Recommend payment terms per supplier (advance %, credit days, TT or LC) using their delay and document record, and estimate the cash flow effect."}, {"id": "X-S5", "text": "Split spend and landed cost by buying entity (the two company names). Is one entity paying more per unit for the same models?"}]}], "brief": "**Your personal brief:** your report date is **21 June 2026** and your focus supplier is **Guangdong Meiran Small Appliances Co., Ltd.**. Treat 21 June 2026 as today: anything dated after it has not happened yet.", "premium": [{"id": "X4", "text": "**Hedge or not.** If every supplier payment had been booked forward at the reference rate on the PO date, what would the company have saved or lost over the year? Show it by quarter."}, {"id": "X3", "text": "**Audit the customs duty.** For each Bill of Entry, back out the BCD rate actually charged from the duty paid and the CIF value. Find the SKD shipments charged at the FG rate and work out the refund claim in rupees (BCD + SWS only)."}, {"id": "X2", "text": "**Predict the ETA.** Using only what was known at departure (supplier, route, port, month, rolled over or not), predict arrival at the final destination. Report the error against the PO register's Revised ETA."}, {"id": "X5", "text": "**Supplier scorecard with weights.** Combine delay, document lateness, demurrage caused and price into one score, run a +/-10% sensitivity on each weight and say which suppliers stay in the top three."}, {"id": "X1", "text": "**Model it properly.** Design a normalised schema (supplier, product, PO, PO line with revisions, shipment, container, event, document, payment) and load it into a real SQL database. Rewrite S7 and S9 as single queries that take the report date as a parameter."}]}$pack$::jsonb
from public.datasets where slug = 'slow-boat-from-ningbo-fy2526'
on conflict (license_code) do nothing;

