age traces back to a single supplier, and what is the common cause?"}, {"id": "S4", "text": "Compare the PO register's `Revised_ETA` with the day each delivered PO actually reached its final destination. What share arrived more than 7 days later than the register said? Is the register a tracker or a wish list?"}, {"id": "S8", "text": "**Documents as of 30 June 2026:** list every document that is overdue, due in the next 14 days, and due in 15 to 30 days, with who owes it. Give the counts for each bucket and say which responsible party owes the most overdue documents."}, {"id": "S5", "text": "Clearance time (arrival at the final destination to Out of Charge) for shipments where the Original BL / Telex Release and the BIS certificate were in hand before arrival, against shipments where they were not."}, {"id": "S2", "text": "Departure delay per supplier: days between Planned ETD and the PO's first Vessel Departed event. Rank the suppliers and show how many POs each figure rests on."}, {"id": "S3", "text": "Sea transit days (Vessel Departed to Arrived at POD) by transshipment port (Colombo, Singapore, Port Klang, direct). How much does the slowest route cost in days against direct sailings?"}, {"id": "S1", "text": "Total ordered value (latest revisions, cancelled excluded) by supplier and by product category, in USD and as a share of the total. Which three suppliers carry the most spend?"}]}, {"key": "dash1", "title": "Phase 3a, Dashboard Page 1: PO and Container Lookup", "tasks": [{"id": "D2", "text": "On the same page show that PO's documents checklist (received, pending, overdue, colour coded) and its payments schedule (paid, due, overdue) with rupee values."}, {"id": "D3", "text": "Add a container search: type a container or BL number and land on the right PO, with the full event history in date order and the source of each event."}, {"id": "D4", "text": "Add a report date control. Changing it must change every number on the page, so the page shows the world as it 